  "reactions": [],
  "conversations": {
    "talk.kessel.cook": {
      "entry": [
        {
          "node": "cook"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "cook": {
          "speaker": "COOK",
          "pages": [
            "He's through that door and down again. After dark. Mind the third step. It has opinions."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "talk.kessel.kessel": {
      "entry": [
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "act1:shutter"
          },
          "node": "after"
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "act1:implant"
          },
          "node": "shutter"
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "flag": "act1:referred"
          },
          "node": "meet"
        },
        {
          "node": "hello"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "meet": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "Mm. The fixer's ghost. Sit. Not there, that one's for the dead. There.",
            "Deleted overnight? It's going around.",
            "I can't give you your record back. Nobody can. But I can give you a way to talk to doors that won't hear you."
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "fit",
              "label": "Do it.",
              "command": "kessel.fit",
              "next": "fitted"
            },
            {
              "id": "what",
              "label": "What is it?",
              "next": "what"
            }
          ]
        },
        "what": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "An implant for your deck. It sees the wiring behind a thing, and lets you ask it, in its own language.",
            "I built half the scanners on that street, once. Consider this an apology to somebody."
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "fit",
              "label": "Do it.",
              "command": "kessel.fit",
              "next": "fitted"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fitted": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "Hold still. … There.",
            "Try it on the shutter. H to look behind it, then pick a verb. Open it."
          ]
        },
        "shutter": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "The shutter. H, then open. It will not bite. What is behind it might stare."
          ]
        },
        "after": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "Shells. Robot bodies, empty. People sell me their old ones. People sell me all sorts.",
            "Don't ask what I do with them. I'll tell you, and you'll stop sleeping.",
            "Go home. Your front door won't know you, but your block has a service latch down the areaway out front. It speaks the same language as that shutter."
          ]
        },
        "hello": {
          "speaker": "DR. KESSEL",
          "pages": [
            "Mm. Not now. I'm between patients, and you are not one yet."
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "native": {
    "verbs": [],
    "events": {},
    "goals": {},
